    <briefdescription>
<para>A deterministic finite-state automaton. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The automaton is defined in <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_table_gen" kindref="compound">TableGen</ref>; this object drives an automaton defined by tblgen-emitted tables.</para>
<para>An automaton accepts a sequence of input tokens (&quot;actions&quot;). This class is templated on the type of these actions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
